{
  "name": "rsi_reversion_adx_low_vix_calm_xrp_ada_link",
  "rationale": "Mid-cap alt reversion in flat, calm conditions: buy RSI oversold on XRP/ADA/LINK when ADX is below a fitted cap (no established trend) and vix_level is low. Thesis: range-bound alts in calm vol mean-revert from oversold. DISCONFIRMER: the ADX cap is the explicit control against momentum \u2014 if a high-ADX (trending) version earns more, the result is trend-following dressed as reversion; the low-VIX gate is the second control proving regime-conditioning, not just oversold entry, drives it.",
  "catalyst": "RSI oversold on a range-bound (low-ADX) alt during a calm-VIX window",
